.TH LIBMPQ__STREAM_SIZE 3 2026-09-24 "The MoPaQ archive library"
.SH NAME
libmpq__stream_size \- return a logical MPQ member size.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <libmpq/mpq.h>
.BI "int32_t libmpq__stream_size(mpq_stream_s *" stream ", libmpq__off_t *" size ");"
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Store the immutable logical unpacked member size in \fI*size\fP. This operation
performs no archive I/O.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns \fBLIBMPQ_SUCCESS\fP on success.
.SH ERRORS
\fBLIBMPQ_ERROR_EXIST\fP reports an invalid stream or output pointer.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR libmpq__stream_tell (3),
.BR libmpq__file_size_unpacked (3)
